ersonalized', '', '[\"Introducing our Personalized Men\'s Leather Bracelet with Kids Names, a custom piece of jewelry designed to be a meaningful gift for the special men in your life. This elegant bracelet is crafted from high-quality leather, ensuring durability and comfort, making it an ideal accessory for everyday wear. What sets this bracelet apart is its ability to be personalized with the names of loved ones, particularly children, making it a cherished keepsake that holds sentimental value.Whether you’re looking for the perfect groomsmen gift, a thoughtful birthday gift, or a memorable Christmas gift for your husband, dad, or another special man in your life, this bracelet is an excellent choice. The sleek design of the bracelet makes it suitable for any occasion, from casual outings to formal events. Its custom engraving adds a personal touch that is sure to make the recipient feel appreciated and loved.This bracelet is not just an accessory but a meaningful gift that celebrates the bonds of family and fatherhood. It serves as a constant reminder of the special connection between a father and his children, making it a heartfelt gift for any dad. Ideal for husbands, dads, and even as a special token for groomsmen, this bracelet is a timeless piece that will be treasured for years to come.Give the gift of love and personalization with our Custom Men’s Bracelet—a gift that’s as unique and special as the man who wears it.★ ABOUT THIS ITEM:Material:  316L Stainless Steel Beads with Stopper + High Quality genuine leather braid wrist band + 316L Stainless Steel Magnetic Clasp (Nickel Free, Anti Allergy)Size: From 6\\\" to 11\\\" Just let us know if you need different size other than those provided above.★INSTRUCTIONS FOR CUSTUMIZATION: Your products will be sent in the size you choose. please make sure that the size you choose is correct, otherwise we cannot take responsibility for the wrong sizeChoose the Number of Beads (up to 10 beads)Write a phrase (up to 10 characters) on each bead.Example: 1- Neil 2- Tara 3- Lionel Please double-check your grammar because we will personalize everything exactly as it appears on the screen.★IS THIS A GIFT?Don\'t worry; it is packaged beautifully and is prepared for gift-giving!If you place multiple orders, we\'ll bundle everything in a single gift box. If you would like them to be packaged separately in individual gift boxes, please send me a note at the time of purchase.\\n        \\n    \\n    \\n        \\n            Learn more about this item\"]', '[\"Order today to get by Dec 27-Jan 2\",\"Returns & exchanges not accepted\",\"Free shipping\",\"Ships from: Richardson, TX\"]', '[{\"specification_name\":\"Lenght & Color\",\"specification_values\":\"7\\\" - Black; 7\\\" - Two Color; 7.5\\\" - Black; 7.5\\\" - Two Color; 8\\\" - Black; 8\\\" - Two Color; 8.5\\\" - Black; 8.5\\\" - Two Color; 9\'\' - Black; 9\\\" - Two Color; 9.5\'\' - Black; 9.5\\\" - Two Color; 10\'\' - Black; 10\\\" - Two Color; 10.5\'\' - Black; 10.5\\\" - Two Color; 11\'\' - Black; 11\\\" - Two Color\"},{\"specification_name\":\"Bead Quantity\",\"specification_values\":\"Without Bead ($18.96); 1 Bead ($28.96); 2 Beads; 3 Beads ($34.96); 4 Beads ($37.96); 5 Beads ($40.96); 6 Beads ($43.96); 7 Beads ($46.96); 8 Beads ($49.96); 9 Beads ($52.96); 10 Beads ($55.96)\"}]', 'null', 'null', '[\"Jewelry\",\"Bracelets\",\"Beaded Bracelets\"]', '[{\"date\":\"2024-12-16\",\"rating\":5,\"reviewr_name\":\"Raven\",\"the_review\":\"No complaints, I love it!\"},{\"date\":\"2024-12-14\",\"rating\":5,\"reviewr_name\":\"Anna\",\"the_review\":\"Going to make a great gift for christmas!\"},{\"date\":\"2024-12-09\",\"rating\":5,\"reviewr_name\":\"Jer███a J███s\",\"the_review\":\"I love the way this bracelet turned out.\"}]', '[\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/b70caa/6492366938/iap_300x300.6492366938_dlumukof.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/0acc9b/6559367457/iap_300x300.6559367457_mk2ehkwj.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.