ristband For Dad.This TRENDY, SIMPLE, MODERN, and COMFORTABLE bracelet is great to wear in any occasion. It can be engraved on the inside of the leather as a secret message, on the outside as shown in the picture, or both sides of the leather band.-TO ORDER THE CORRECT SIZE: Please refer to the listing Pictures.-Note: -Drop down menu option for leather Color, engraving side, where you want your bracelet to be engraved.Out-In/Outside and Inside engraving, Out-Outside engraving  and In-Inside engraving.If you select Out Option in the drop down menu, the engraving will be on the outside not on the inside, So please select the correct option.---Please NOTE: Clasp color and the cotton cord color may varies a little bit due the fabrication process.Bracelet Specifications:____________________________-10mm Full Grain Leather-Antique Red Copper Clasp-Antique Bronze Clasp -Cotton cordTo maintain the quality and the beauty of your leather accessory , please DO NOT expose it to the water such as the shower, pool, spa, or the beach! ---Please Note: Sometimes the clasp color and the cotton cord color may varies a little bit due the fabrication process.Engraving Details:_____________________-I can engrave up to 50 characters including spaces, on the bracelet per side. Do not exced the characters limit, It will help us to speed up completion process of your order.-This bracelet can be personalized with own phrase, Letters, numbers, messages, dates, coordinates, roman numerals,names, favorite places..........HOW TO ORDER:____________________First): In the drop down menu it will give you options for leather color, engraving option and clasp color.Second): Choose the size the bracelet needs to be.Third): Add to carFourth): Upon check out, there is a NOTE TO SELLER where you can specify your personalization and font# from the last picture in the listing. Make it as clear as possible, easy understandable instructions will significantly speed up completion process. Presentation:_______________All bracelets are packaged neatly and ready to give as a gift for any occasion.-All my bracelet are 100% HANDCRAFT.HOW TO ORDER THE CORRECT SIZE:___________________________________________-To order the correct size, measure the wrist with a piece of string, just below the wrist bone, where you would normally wear the bracelet. Add extra room for a comfortable wear. Measure the piece of string and that will be the correct wrist size to order.-Please note the wrist size you order will be the inside circumference of the bracelet, NOT the total length of the bracelet. Please make sure you add extra room for a comfortable wear. I WILL NOT ADD EXTRA ROOM TO THE WRIST SIZE REQUESTED.-Contact me for any special request.SHIPPING:____________All items are shipped first Class USPS mail with a tracking number (USA only). Normally delivered USA 2-5 Business Days, International 2-3 Weeks.\\n        \\n    \\n    \\n        \\n            Learn more about this item\"]', '[\"Order today to get by Dec 20-30\",\"Returns & exchanges not accepted\",\"Free shipping\",\"Ships from: Corona, CA\"]', '[{\"specification_name\":\"Leather Color/Engraving Side/Clasp Color\",\"specification_values\":\"Brown/Out-In/Copper ($40.00); Brown/Outside/Copper ($30.00); Brown/Inside/Copper ($30.00); Brown/Out-In/Bronze ($38.00); Brown/Outside/Bronze ($32.00); Brown/Inside/Bronze ($32.00); Black/Out-In/Copper ($38.00); Black/Outside/Copper ($30.00); Black/Inside/Copper ($32.00); Black/Out-In/Bronze ($38.00); Black/Outside/Bronze ($30.00); Black/Inside/Bronze ($30.00); LBrown/Out-In/Copper ($38.00); LBrown/Out/Copper ($30.00); LBrown/Inside/Copper ($32.00); LBrown/Out-In/Bronze; LBrown/Out/Bronze ($29.00); LBrown/Inside/Bronze ($32.00); Chcolat/Out-In/Brnze ($36.00); Chocolate/Out/Bronze ($32.00); Chcolat/Inside/Brnze ($32.00); Chocola/Out-In/Coper ($39.00); Chocolate/Out/Copper ($32.00); Chocol/Inside/Copper ($32.00)\"},{\"specification_name\":\"Size\",\"specification_values\":\"Select a size; 6 inc