s of Formula One Licensing B.V.F1 Wallart\\n        \\n    \\n    \\n        \\n            Learn more about this item\"]', '[\"Order today to get by Dec 23-Jan 2\",\"Returns & exchanges accepted within 30 days\",\"Cost to ship: $5.99\\n            \\n    Enjoy free shipping to the US when you spend $35+ at this shop.\",\"Ships from: Charlotte, NC\"]', '[{\"specification_name\":\"Size\",\"specification_values\":\"Select a size; Digital Download ($11.73); 8x10 Print Only ($27.37); 12x16 Print Only ($35.19); 16x20 Print Only ($44.96); 18x24 Print Only ($52.78); 24x36 Print Only ($70.38); 8x10 Framed (Black) ($54.74); 12x16 Framed (Black) ($70.38); 16x20 Framed (Black) ($95.79); 18x24 Framed (Black); 24x36 Framed (Black) ($172.04); 16x20 Canvas ($84.06); 18x24 Canvas ($95.79); 24x36 Canvas ($142.71)\"}]', 'null', 'null', '[\"Art & Collectibles\",\"Prints\",\"Digital Prints\"]', 'null', '[\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/c59d0e/6294471825/iap_300x300.6294471825_ntbjcbo3.jpg?version=0\"]', '\"2024-10-17T00:00:00.000Z\"', 'https://www.etsy.com/shop/CorsaCurated?ref=shop-header-name&listing_id=1665129862&from_page=listing', '20218854328', '[{\"type\":\"Size\",\"value\":\"18x24 Framed (Black)\"}]', '[{\"type\":\"Size\",\"value\":[\"Digital Download ($11.73)\",\"8x10 Print Only ($27.37)\",\"12x16 Print Only ($35.19)\",\"16x20 Print Only ($44.96)\",\"18x24 Print Only ($52.78)\",\"24x36 Print Only ($70.38)\",\"8x10 Framed (Black) ($54.74)\",\"12x16 Framed (Black) ($70.38)\",\"16x20 Framed (Black) ($95.79)\",\"18x24 Framed (Black)\",\"24x36 Framed (Black) ($172.04)\",\"16x20 Canvas ($84.06)\",\"18x24 Canvas ($95.79)\",\"24x36 Canvas ($142.71)\"]}]', '2026-05-25 22:40:49');
