 characters) on each bead.Example: 1- Neil 2- Tara 3- Lionel Please double-check your grammar because we will personalize everything exactly as it appears on the screen.★IS THIS A GIFT?Don\'t worry; it is packaged beautifully and is prepared for gift-giving!If you place multiple orders, we\'ll bundle everything in a single gift box. If you would like them to be packaged separately in individual gift boxes, please send me a note at the time of purchase.\\n        \\n    \\n    \\n        \\n            Learn more about this item\"]', '[\"Order today to get by Dec 27-Jan 2\",\"Returns & exchanges not accepted\",\"Free shipping\",\"Ships from: Richardson, TX\"]', '[{\"specification_name\":\"Lenght & Color\",\"specification_values\":\"7\\\" - Black; 7\\\" - Two Color; 7.5\\\" - Black; 7.5\\\" - Two Color; 8\\\" - Black; 8\\\" - Two Color; 8.5\\\" - Black; 8.5\\\" - Two Color; 9\'\' - Black; 9\\\" - Two Color; 9.5\'\' - Black; 9.5\\\" - Two Color; 10\'\' - Black; 10\\\" - Two Color; 10.5\'\' - Black; 10.5\\\" - Two Color; 11\'\' - Black; 11\\\" - Two Color\"},{\"specification_name\":\"Bead Quantity\",\"specification_values\":\"Without Bead ($18.96); 1 Bead ($28.96); 2 Beads ($31.96); 3 Beads ($34.96); 4 Beads ($37.96); 5 Beads ($40.96); 6 Beads ($43.96); 7 Beads ($46.96); 8 Beads ($49.96); 9 Beads ($52.96); 10 Beads\"}]', 'null', 'null', '[\"Jewelry\",\"Bracelets\",\"Beaded Bracelets\"]', '[{\"date\":\"2024-12-16\",\"rating\":5,\"reviewr_name\":\"Raven\",\"the_review\":\"No complaints, I love it!\"},{\"date\":\"2024-12-14\",\"rating\":5,\"reviewr_name\":\"Anna\",\"the_review\":\"Going to make a great gift for christmas!\"},{\"date\":\"2024-12-09\",\"rating\":5,\"reviewr_name\":\"Jer███a J███s\",\"the_review\":\"I love the way this bracelet turned out.\"}]', '[\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/b70caa/6492366938/iap_300x300.6492366938_dlumukof.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/0acc9b/6559367457/iap_300x300.6559367457_mk2ehkwj.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystati