celet makes a perfect Christmas gift for the special men in your life—whether it’s your husband, father, or son. Exquisitely crafted with a blend of leather elegance and a stainless steel infinity knot charm, this bracelet symbolizes endless love and timeless style.★ ITEM DETAILS:• Quality materials: Crafted from premium Nappa Leather, this leather is made to be durable, waterproof and smooth, making it the ideal choice for high-end jewelry.•  Stainless Steel Charm and clasp, coated with a thin layer of white gold for a luxurious appearance and enhanced durability.• Personalization Options: The clasp can be personalized with your chosen text, making it a unique and meaningful piece.• Versatile Sizes: Catering to different wrist sizes, this bracelet comes in 6.5\\\" for smaller wrists, 7.5\\\" for medium wrists (the most common size), and 8.5\\\" for larger wrists or 9.5\\\" for extra large wrists.• Handcrafted in USA★ PROCESSING TIMEPlease note that this bracelet requires 5-7 days to ship out, as it is made with careful attention to detail and quality.★ SHIPPING• Standard Delivery in the United States: Shipped via USPS First Class Mail, expect a delivery time of 3-6 business days.• Expedited Shipping Option: Choose USPS Priority for faster delivery, typically within 1-4 business days.★ RETURNS POLICYIf you decide to return a non-personalized bracelet, you have the option to exchange it for a different size. However, please be aware that you will be responsible for covering the shipping costs both ways. It\'s important to note that personalized items are considered final sale and cannot be returned.Keywords:Infinity Knot Bracelet for Men, Personalized Leather Bracelet for Men, Christmas Gift for Husband, Gift for Dad from Son or Daughter, Men’s Leather Bracelet with Infinity Charm, Stainless Steel Infinity Knot Bracelet, Meaningful Men’s Jewelry Gift,Custom Men’s Bracelet for Christmas, Symbol of Love Bracelet for MenElegant Men’s Bracelet Gift, Father Son Bracelet GiftAnniversary Bracelet for Men, Men’s Bracelet with Hidden Message OptionSpecial Gift for Boyfriend or Husband, Infinity Knot Bracelet Christmas Gift\\n        \\n    \\n    \\n        \\n            Learn more about this item\"]', '[\"Order today to get by Dec 26-Jan 4\",\"Returns & exchanges accepted within 7 days\",\"Free shipping\",\"Ships from: Higganum, CT\"]', '[{\"specification_name\":\"Leather Color\",\"specification_values\":\"Black; Brown\"},{\"specification_name\":\"Size\",\"specification_values\":\"S/M - 7.5\\\"; M/L - 8.5\\\"; XL - 9\\\"\"}]', 'null', 'null', '[\"Jewelry\",\"Bracelets\",\"Charm Bracelets\"]', '[{\"date\":\"2024-12-17\",\"rating\":5,\"reviewr_name\":\"Tab███a B███r\",\"the_review\":\"This bracelet is exactly what I wanted!!\"},{\"date\":\"2024-12-17\",\"rating\":5,\"reviewr_name\":\"Daw███ned███\",\"the_review\":\"The bracelet looks great & is well-made.\"},{\"date\":\"2024-12-17\",\"rating\":5,\"reviewr_name\":\"Sha███\",\"the_review\":\"I can’t wait to give this beautiful gift to my husband!\"},{\"date\":\"2024-12-17\",\"rating\":5,\"reviewr_name\":\"Mel███ Ro███son███\",\"the_review\":\"Very nice classy piece. Good quality!\"}]', '[\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/cbe3c3/6556763685/iap_300x300.6556763685_korohmmc.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/43779e/6420561703/iap_300x300.6420561703_j7gy66kz.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/383603/6387347689/iap_300x300.6387347689_3meelkd7.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/da98fb/6308863334/iap_300x300.6308863334_42hc29fo.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/7ec163/6349969193/iap_300x300.6349969193_54po8219.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/fc947e/6324637579/iap_300x300.6324637579_t1w96co9.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/cc5e52/6206438320/iap_300x300.6206438320_h5zcr20z.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/86a4db/6150740537/iap_300x300.6150740537_oz9bzztd.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/aa77ea/60