-Shirt Color (Primary color)For Example; White4.- Enter your Size (They fit pretty true to size!)5.- Use our personalization box to write the details, for example additional words for your design, different colors.6.- Click add to cart. You can go back to add more products!!7.-Click \\\"Proceed to check out\\\"8.- When you check out, you can add a note to seller for any requestCare InstructionsWash item inside out in cold water, do not bleach, do not dry clean, do not iron directly on the design.Production and ShippingT-shirt Unisex:- 100% cotton- Fabric weight: 6.0 oz/y² (203.4 g/m²)- Pre-shrunk- Shoulder-to-shoulder taping- Seamless double-needle 7/8\\\" (2.2 cm) collar- Double-needle stitched sleeves and bottom hem- Quarter-turned to avoid crease down the middleIdeal for any situation, a unisex heavy blend crewneck sweatshirt is pure comfort. These garments are made from polyester and cotton. This combination helps designs come out looking fresh and beautiful. The collar is ribbed knit, so it retains its shape even after washing. There are no itchy side seams on these sweaters..: 50% Cotton 50% Polyester.: Medium-heavy fabric (8.0 oz/yd² (271.25 g/m²)).: Loose fit.: Sewn in label.: Runs true to size Our hoodies are super comfortable and the quality is very good, they are manufactured with cotton fibers to ensure comfort and durability. Polyester fibers are extremely strong, resistant to most chemicals, along with shrinkage.50% cotton, 50% polyester.The size chart is in the last photo and if you want it to look like this oversized style, choose 2 to 3 sizes larger than you normally use. Example: if you use size P choose between L or XL.I’m very happy to be selling this sweatshirt and when it arrives to you be sure to send me a photo showing, this will make my day very happy and I will be very grateful!!\\n        \\n    \\n    \\n        \\n            Learn more about this item\"]', '[\"Order today to get by Dec 23-Jan 2\",\"Returns & exchanges accepted within 7 