_______All bracelets are packaged neatly and ready to give as a gift for any occasion.-All my bracelet are 100% HANDCRAFT.HOW TO ORDER THE CORRECT SIZE:___________________________________________-To order the correct size, measure the wrist with a piece of string, just below the wrist bone, where you would normally wear the bracelet. Add extra room for a comfortable wear. Measure the piece of string and that will be the correct wrist size to order.-Please note the wrist size you order will be the inside circumference of the bracelet, NOT the total length of the bracelet. Please make sure you add extra room for a comfortable wear. I WILL NOT ADD EXTRA ROOM TO THE WRIST SIZE REQUESTED.-Contact me for any special request.SHIPPING:____________All items are shipped first Class USPS mail with a tracking number (USA only). Normally delivered USA 2-5 Business Days, International 2-3 Weeks.\\n        \\n    \\n    \\n        \\n            Learn more about this item\"]', '[\"Order today to get by Dec 20-30\",\"Returns & exchanges not accepted\",\"Free shipping\",\"Ships from: Corona, CA\"]', '[{\"specification_name\":\"Leather Color/Engraving Side/Clasp Color\",\"specification_values\":\"Brown/Out-In/Copper ($40.00); Brown/Outside/Copper ($30.00); Brown/Inside/Copper ($30.00); Brown/Out-In/Bronze ($38.00); Brown/Outside/Bronze ($32.00); Brown/Inside/Bronze ($32.00); Black/Out-In/Copper; Black/Outside/Copper ($30.00); Black/Inside/Copper ($32.00); Black/Out-In/Bronze ($38.00); Black/Outside/Bronze ($30.00); Black/Inside/Bronze ($30.00); LBrown/Out-In/Copper ($38.00); LBrown/Out/Copper ($30.00); LBrown/Inside/Copper ($32.00); LBrown/Out-In/Bronze ($38.00); LBrown/Out/Bronze ($29.00); LBrown/Inside/Bronze ($32.00); Chcolat/Out-In/Brnze ($36.00); Chocolate/Out/Bronze ($32.00); Chcolat/Inside/Brnze ($32.00); Chocola/Out-In/Coper ($39.00); Chocolate/Out/Copper ($32.00); Chocol/Inside/Copper ($32.00)\"},{\"specification_name\":\"Size\",\"specification_values\":\"Select a size; 6 inches; 6.5 inches; 7 inches; 7.5 inches; 8 inches; 8.5 inches; 9 inches\"}]', 'null', 'null', '[\"Jewelry\",\"Bracelets\",\"Bangles\"]', '[{\"date\":\"2024-12-17\",\"rating\":5,\"reviewr_name\":\"amy███she███\",\"the_review\":\"Quick shipping nice quality exceeded my expectations\"},{\"date\":\"2024-12-17\",\"rating\":5,\"reviewr_name\":\"dix███imp███200███\",\"the_review\":\"This will make the perfect gift. Thank you\"},{\"date\":\"2024-12-16\",\"rating\":5,\"reviewr_name\":\"phi███dam███adu██████\",\"the_review\":\"Awesome experience and great quality item! Excited to give it to my husband.\"},{\"date\":\"2024-12-16\",\"rating\":5,\"reviewr_name\":\"Chr███ine███\",\"the_review\":\"Outstanding customer service! I couldn’t have asked for a better product. These are absolutely gorgeous and highly recommended.\"}]', '[\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/4feee8/6529361535/iap_300x300.6529361535_arcn0yx4.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/639dfa/6493856891/iap_300x300.6493856891_2xr84gbk.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/202e00/6358903851/iap_300x300.6358903851_k4dnxeah.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/7e6bd0/6240993506/iap_300x300.6240993506_kcp23k2s.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/dffbd6/6131994700/iap_300x300.6131994700_9ijgj50u.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/93328a/6164335505/iap_300x300.6164335505_iivugdaf.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/b586a5/6048625294/iap_300x300.6048625294_pzptiwwo.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/56d872/6042660934/iap_300x300.6042660934_a7evu3me.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/01e2f1/5992264234/iap_300x300.5992264234_tnhhs8nj.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/ed9e11/5959447652/iap_300x300.5959447652_mvg002fx.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/e63486/5938177260/iap_300x300.5938177260_3b6cttbc.jpg?version=0\",\"https://i.etsystatic.com/iap/6141e4/5924416084/iap_300x300.5924416084_am1cxg7a.jpg?version=0\",\"https:/