_______All bracelets are packaged neatly and ready to give as a gift for any occasion.-All my bracelet are 100% HANDCRAFT.HOW TO ORDER THE CORRECT SIZE:___________________________________________-To order the correct size, measure the wrist with a piece of string, just below the wrist bone, where you would normally wear the bracelet. Add extra room for a comfortable wear. Measure the piece of string and that will be the correct wrist size to order.-Please note the wrist size you order will be the inside circumference of the bracelet, NOT the total length of the bracelet. Please make sure you add extra room for a comfortable wear. I WILL NOT ADD EXTRA ROOM TO THE WRIST SIZE REQUESTED.-Contact me for any special request.SHIPPING:____________All items are shipped first Class USPS mail with a tracking number (USA only). Normally delivered USA 2-5 Business Days, International 2-3 Weeks.\\n        \\n    \\n    \\n        \\n            Learn more about this item\"]', '[\"Order today to get by Dec 20-26\",\"Returns & exchanges not accepted\",\"Free shipping\",\"Ships from: Corona, CA\"]', '[{\"specification_name\":\"Leather Color/Engraving Side/Clasp Color\",\"specification_values\":\"Brown/Out-In/Copper ($40.00); Brown/Outside/Copper ($30.00); Brown/Inside/Copper ($30.00); Brown/Out-In/Bronze ($38.00); Brown/Outside/Bronze; Brown/Inside/Bronze ($32.00); Black/Out-In/Copper ($38.00); Black/Outside/Copper ($30.00); Black/Inside/Copper ($32.00); Black/Out-In/Bronze ($38.00); Black/Outside/Bronze ($30.00); Black/Inside/Bronze ($30.00); LBrown/Out-In/Copper ($38.00); LBrown/Out/Copper ($30.00); LBrown/Inside/Copper ($32.00); LBrown/Out-In/Bronze ($38.00); LBrown/Out/Bronze ($29.00); LBrown/Inside/Bronze ($32.00); Chcolat/Out-In/Brnze ($36.00); Chocolate/Out/Bronze ($32.00); Chcolat/Inside/Brnze ($32.00); Chocola/Out-In/Coper ($39.00); Chocolate/Out/Copper ($32.00); Chocol/Inside/Copper ($32.00)\"},{\"specification_name\":\"Size\",\"specification_values\":\"Select a size; 6 in