of a wish!  These traditional Wish Bracelets make the perfect gift for any occasion or a special treat for yourself!      ☆ CREATE YOUR WISH ☆1. Choose Your Cord ColorRed, Cranberry, Orange, Yellow, Bright Green, Green, Light Blue, Navy, Blue, Teal, Aqua, Purple, Light Purple, Pink, Light Pink, Coral, Almond, Toffee, Brown, Black, Light Gray, Gray and White2. Choose Your Card     -Wish Bracelet     -Custom Wording3. Customize Your Wish- Select Basic Wish Wording will appear at the top of the cardGo to Add your personalization and type in your wordingLeave it blank and it will say Happy Birthday!☆ WISH POEM ☆Printed at the bottom of the card on recycled Kraft paper“Tie this Bracelet to your wrist,as you do make a wishWhen this Bracelet breaks in two,Legend says your wish will come true”☆ MATERIALS ☆Bracelet: 1mm Biodegradable water-resistant waxed cotton cord Charm: Size Varies Silver-lead and nickel free☆SIZING ☆Bracelets are 12 inches  Anklets are 14 inches☆HOW TO USE ☆1. Tie the bracelet to your wrist or anklet while making your wish2. Cut off the excess cord☆ HOW TO PERSONALIZE YOUR GIFT ☆ Use the personalization box to have your gift message printed on the Top of the Wish Card☆ READY FOR GIFTING ☆Bracelets come packaged in resealable clear cellophane bags. Bracelets can be individually wrapped in our signature tissue paper upon request.  ☆ PROCESSING TIME ☆Your handmade bracelet will be ready to ship within 1 to 3 business days☆ WARNING ☆Choking Hazard- Not for Children under 5 years old☆RED STRING OF FATE WISH BRACELET ☆https://www.etsy.com/listing/760721474☆ ROADRUNNER WISH BRACELET ☆https://www.etsy.com/listing/819322074☆BIKE WISH BRACELET ☆https://www.etsy.com/listing/789280633☆ SEE OUR FULL WISH BRACELET COLLECTION ☆https://www.etsy.com/shop/SalemWishes☆ DISCOUNT ☆Join our email list for exclusive discounts: https://eepurl.com/geM1X9MAY ALL YOUR WISHES COME TRUE!\\n        \\n    \\n    \\n        \\n            Learn more about this item\"]', '[\"Order tod